worker_module_budget
  module "formal_ai_worker_seed_responses_and_language.js"
  ceiling 920
  rationale "Seed hydration with its bootstrap fallbacks, the localized response lookup, response-language detection, prompt normalization and concept record matching. Issue #658 cut this module out of one oversized worker file by line count; R1188-U5 named it after what it holds. Its ceiling falls as its logic moves into js/wasm-worker. Ceiling moved 1297 to 1299 for the timezone-places seed cache this shard declares and invalidates while shard 09 reads it (entity-grounded hours batch); a duplicated reset line was removed. Ceiling moved 1299 to 1300 for issue #1021 R1021-6: hydrateLinoSeedText ends by learning the program tasks the worker tables lack from data/seed/hello-world-programs.lino (installSeedProgramTasks in formal_ai_worker_program_requests.js), so copy stdin to stdout is a catalogued task in the browser as it is in Rust. Lowered to 1253 for issue #918 (2026-10-08): the bootstrap copies of the brainstorm and persona seeds are gone; both fill from data/seed when the seed loads. Lowered to 1208 the same day: the concept request leads, question starts and articles are seed cue records (conceptQueryCues), and the bootstrap concept prefix and suffix lists are gone. Ceiling moved 1208 to 1232: normalizePrompt rewrites the seeded contracted token pairs of data/seed/languages.lino into their expansions (expandSeededContractions, issue #1175 p020, 2026-10-08), so `you're` meets a surface the seed writes as `you are`; the Rust twin is expand_contractions in rust/src/engine.rs. Ceiling moved 1232 to 1233 (2026-10-08, issue #1165 R1165-6): hydrateLinoSeedText also calls installDocumentedLanguageCommands (formal_ai_worker_documented_commands.js), so a catalog row takes each check or run command a captured documentation page states from that page, as program_languages does in Rust. Lowered from 1233 to 925 on 2026-10-08 for R1188-U1: the bootstrap copies of the intent routes (with their multilingual phrases) and of the unknown answer left, the worker reads both from the hydrated seed. Ceiling moved 925 to 928 (R1188-U5): the first comment lines say what the module holds."
